``` [...] # About Infinigen

Infinigen is a procedural generator of 3D scenes, developed byPrinceton Vision & Learning Lab. Infinigen is optimized for computer vision research and generates diverse high-quality 3D training data. Infinigen is based on Blender and is free and open-source (BSD 3-Clause License). Infinigen is being actively developed to expand its capabilities and coverage. Everyone is welcome to contribute.

